        <div class="divider"></div>

        <h2>🦅 YOUR JOURNEY STARTS HERE</h2>
        <p>🎯 Pass your tryout. ⚔️ Earn your rank. 🏆 Fight your way to the top.</p>

        <div class="cta-section">
            <a href="https://discord.gg/8FtnZJtcj" class="btn" target="_blank">Join EK Discord Server</a>
        </div>

        <div class="stats-footer">
            <p>👥 1,030+ SERVER MEMBERS</p>
            <p>🌍 ALL REGIONS • ALL DEVICES • ONE COMMUNITY</p>
        </div>

        <div class="motto-box">
            <p style="color: #fff;">⚔️ EK — WE DON'T FOLLOW THE META.</p>
            <p style="color: var(--primary-color);">🔥 WE DOMINATE IT.</p>
            <p style="color: #fff; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 10px;">🦅 TOGETHER WE EXPLORE. TOGETHER WE CONQUER.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
